From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v0lumehi <aljic.zijad@googlemail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:33:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Runtime game profile: dm_profile() and DM_PROFILE

The host reads a game profile at run time (hle_profile.c), with the compiled game_profile.h as the fallback and
DM_PROF_<key> overrides on top. game.py gains a "profile" subcommand that writes the file.
Touches every file that used a DM_GAME_* macro for the memory layout, game_env, alloc_big_align and the program id.

Upstream-Status: pending (design note seedds/nxnative#492)
Reason: One host binary for every game: the profile constants are read at run time (DM_PROFILE, dm_profile()), not only as compile-time macros; the launcher needs it
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#123
---
